      "id": 4326029,
      "name": "[Phoenix] Fate's Judgment - Lv.50",
      "desc": "Phoenix's exclusive Tactical Prism.\nIncreases Medicine's restoration effect by 25%. When using Medicine or launching an Ultimate, the CRIT DMG of Attribute Anomaly DMG taken by enemies affected by [Sear] increases by an additional 10% for 300s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.\nPhoenix's <color=#FFFFFF>[Dash Attack]</color> is replaced with <color=#FFFFFF>[Dodge Counter]</color>. After a <color=#FFFFFF>[Dodge Counter]</color>, hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to keep spinning and slashing enemies. After launching an <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color>, Phoenix takes 80% less DMG for 3s, and all squad members' Attribute Anomaly CRIT DMG increases by 40% for 60s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.",
